  "bo_system": "Northgate M3",
  "development_type": "Major all other major developments",
  "lapsed_date": "20/12/2009",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - .",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be begun before the expiration of five years from the date of this permission.",
    "Condition : 3 - The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the extension hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing building.",
    "Condition : 4 - The proposed development shall be carried out in all respects in accordance with the proposals contained in the application and the plans submitted therewith and approved by the Local Planning Authority, or as shall have been otherwise agreed in writing by the Local Planning Authority (before the building(s) is/are occupied/used).",
    "Condition : 5 - No additional flank windows or other glazed openings shall be formed in any wall of the extension hereby approved without the prior written consent of the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 6 - The roof area of the extension hereby permitted shall not be used as a balcony, roof garden or similar amenity area without the grant of further specific permission from the Local Planning Authority.",
    "Condition : 7 - The use hereby permitted shall not be begun until details of the arrangements for storing of waste and recycled materials have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.  The arrangements for storing waste and recycled materials shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given and shall be completed before any part of the accommodation hereby permitted is occupied.",
    "Condition : 8 - The use hereby permitted for the conversion of dwellinghouse into two flats shall not be begun until full particulars and details of a scheme to insulate the premises against the transmission of airborne and impact sound has been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority and the development shall not be carried out otherwise than in accordance with any approval given.",
    "Condition : 9 - Before the development hereby permitted is commenced a scheme indicating the compliance of the ground floor flat to the Council's Think Access Guidelines, allowing access for people with disabilities, shall have been submitted to and approved by the Local Planning Authority.  The agreed scheme shall be implemented before the development hereby permitted is brought into use.",
    "Condition : 10 - Before the development hereby permitted is first brought into use a visibility splay of 2.4m deep x 2.4m wide shall be provided on each side of the vehicle access, the depth measured from the back of the footway and the widths outwards from the edges of the access, and the existing gateway shall be removed with no fence, wall or other obstruction to visibility exceeding 0.6m in height above the surface of the adjoining highway shall be erected to the west of the vehicle access.",
    "Condition : 11 - The detached outbuilding at the rear of the site shall only be used for purposes ancillary to the enjoyment of the flats at No. 9 Bulstrode Road, and for no other purpose (e.g. it shall not be used as a bedroom, living room or office)"
  ],
